==Strategy==
It is an exact copy of [[Attack on R-Cyclone (Expert)|Attack on R-Cyclone]]. However, there is now a restriction in place, leaving the player unable to use meatshields and many cats that would otherwise nullify the danger of the stage, such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. However, that doesn't mean that there aren't any units who reduce the difficulty of this stage enormously. This stage does not require Ubers, but its difficulty ramps up highly from the previous stage, to the point where, without Ubers, this stage requires a lot of resources to beat, while the previous one could be completed very early on with little effort.

Non-Uber suggestions include [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] and [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]].

